# Last Alive — web app environment
#
# With NO Supabase variables set, the app runs on an in-process memory store —
# zero config, good for local development and the M1 single-player demo.
#
# Set both variables to switch to the Supabase-backed store (durable, the path
# used in production and required for multiplayer from M3 on). After setting
# them: apply packages/db/migrations, then run `pnpm --filter @last-alive/db seed`.

# SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=YOUR-SERVICE-ROLE-KEY

# AI characters (ANURA, AI-gated puzzles). With NO key set, the AI layer runs
# in MOCK mode — deterministic stand-in characters and a keyword judge — so the
# game is fully playable offline. Set the key for live Claude conversations.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
